  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who support or are sympathetic to Donald Trump's political stance, particularly those who endorse or are influenced by the idea of a Muslim ban as a policy to prevent terrorism. This includes right-leaning political supporters, followers of Trump’s rhetoric, and those who align with Islamophobic narratives. The meme leverages Trump’s image and gesture to appeal to this audience by associating him with a policy they may support, while implicitly targeting Muslims as a group through the stereotype of terrorism associations with Muslims. The audience is likely to be drawn to the meme’s framing of Muslims as a threat and the policy as a solution, reinforcing existing biases and promoting division.",
